  "o_intro": {
    "message": "The side panel covers everyday use; this page is for editing many rules at once. One rule per line: <code>URL match =&gt; tab name [; icon=…] [; color=…]</code>. The first matching line wins, and lines starting with <code>#</code> are comments. ⌘/Ctrl+S saves."
  },
